hJO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"722847b4-2e77-44d0-b1a9-17f4aa07b79c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"地道にこれ読みます\n\u003chttps://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/s10664-019-09772-z.pdf\u003e","ts":"1629708539.116000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V3+H9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a24ee5a1-7160-494b-b061-af7563f89bba","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"だから　Patience sortingをしらべるべきか","ts":"1629708174.115300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"200fu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e654673-11f3-4696-a2ff-2a5916edb8ec","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ざっと調べた感じだと\n「Patience sorting algorithm」というアルゴリズムがあって、このアルゴリズムのルールを継承しつつ高速化を図ったのが「Histogram algorithm」っぽい","ts":"1629708156.114900","thread_ts":"1629708156.114900","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xsiF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d92ede5-f6d1-4d66-8dea-58726367aa37","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://ishiotks.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/11/07/125615\u003e\n\u0026gt; 研究のアプローチは、21,590件の変更に対して、母集団を代表できるよう377件をサンプリングして、それらを手作業で調査する\n地道だ。。","ts":"1629708000.113000","attachments":[{"fallback":"ソフトウェア工学研究の日々: ソースコード差分を集めるための git diff では --histogram を使うべき - ソフトウェア工学研究の日々","id":1,"title":"ソースコード差分を集めるための git diff では --histogram を使うべき - ソフトウェア工学研究の日々","title_link":"https://ishiotks.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/11/07/125615","text":"当研究室博士後期課程の Yusuf Sulistyo Nugroho さんが発表した、言いたいことは論文のサブタイトル（\"Use --histogram for code changes\"）で終わっている論文です。オープンアクセスとなっているので、どなたでも全文をダウンロードできます。 \u003chttp://link.springer.com|link.springer.com\u003e git diff では使用するアルゴリズムをいくつかから選ぶことができます（参考：Git のオプションをまとめられている方の記事）。この論文では、アルゴリズムを histogram にした場合としない場合でどちらが良いか、また、そのような差が、diff をベースにしてバグが最…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/98012380853910288/26006613462314455/1593739807","blocks":null,"ts":1573098975,"service_name":"ソフトウェア工学研究の日々","service_icon":"https://ishiotks.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://ishiotks.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/11/07/125615","original_url":"https://ishiotks.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/11/07/125615"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pVexB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4be6ace9-3789-4244-9f31-0d6f81a4928b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"修正しました","ts":"1629707993.112800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vEU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce788df8-e7d9-420c-aa67-1d5e2d4b552c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"一応difftoolにmeld設定してるけど滅多に使わないな、操作感で言うならVimの方がいいし","ts":"1629707932.112100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XSKw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc9a0bb9-8f41-4865-95d4-e334450b83ce","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"メモ：とりあえずこの論文に Myers のアルゴリズム（git diff のデフォルトらしい）と histogram のアルゴリズムについての説明がありそう\n\u003chttps://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/s10664-019-09772-z.pdf\u003e","ts":"1629707918.111600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cXUW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3b90351-cf94-4d21-b1c3-7f01d40f8696","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ソースは公開してないっぽい。。？","ts":"1629707911.111300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gLn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35b5ecaf-c39b-4e35-8051-5ff29862ca67","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あら、diffの色にならないですね。","ts":"1629707846.110100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a/I"}]},{"client_msg_id